Elliott-Morgan-Johnson-Wolfe-Magoffin-Floyd-Lee-Breathitt-Knott-

Owsley-Perry-Clay-Leslie-Letcher-Martin-Pike-

1200 AM EDT Fri Aug 15 2025



This Hazardous Weather Outlook is for a portion of eastern Kentucky.



.DAY ONE...Overnight.



Areas of fog will be around overnight and become locally dense in the

valleys. 



.DAYS TWO THROUGH SEVEN...Friday through Wednesday.



Look for locally dense areas of fog in the valleys early Friday

morning. 



A few areas in extreme eastern Kentucky may be affected by storms on

Friday and Saturday afternoons, and again on Monday, before rain and

storm chances become more prevalent on Tuesday and Wednesday.



.SPOTTER INFORMATION STATEMENT...



Spotter activation is not expected at this time.



$$



