2-3 hours before settling on normal drainage patterns by 05Z. Will

leave the TEMPO -TSRA in through 01Z and hopefully that will be 

long enough.  May need to extend the TEMPO group for outflow 

winds a bit past 01Z. There should not be any ceiling issues.





