.AVIATION /00Z TAFS THROUGH 00Z FRIDAY/...

Issued at 511 PM MDT Thu Aug 14 2025

Isold shra/-tsra with some gusty winds will be possible in and

around the 3 taf sites, KPUB, KALS and KCOS early this evening

and then should dissipate. Cant rule out islod -tsra late

tomorrow afternoon tomorrow, but confidence is low. Otherwise

expect VFR at the 3 taf sites for the next 24 hours. Winds will

be primarily diurnally driven. 





