Flagstaff Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2340 UTC Thursday, August 14, 2025



.AVIATION...Friday 15/00Z through Saturday 16/00Z...Mainly VFR

conditions. Scattered -SHRA/-TSRA through 03Z then mainly 

isolated -SHRA. Scattered -SHRA/-TSRA returns between 18-21Z

Friday. Brief MVFR conditions and gusty, erratic winds possible 

in and around thunderstorms. Outside of storms, expect light and 

variable or terrain driven winds overnight. SW 10-15 kts with 

gusts 20-25 kts during the day Friday.

OUTLOOK...Saturday 16/00Z through Monday 18/00Z...Mainly VFR

conditions. Scattered SHRA/TSRA on Saturday, more isolated

SHRA/TSRA on Sunday, mainly over the higher terrain. Brief MVFR 

conditions and gusty, erratic winds possible in and around 

thunderstorms. Outside of storms, southwest winds 5-15 kts each 

day with light and variable winds overnight.





